    "description": "On this tour, you’ll have the chance to explore some of the highlights of Paris while riding on a sidecar motorcycle. \r\n\r\nAfter meeting your driver, you’ll set off on a two-hour city tour, making stops at various locations. You’ll start at the Rue de la Paix and travel towards the Palais Garnier opera house, where you can make a brief stop for pictures. You’ll then ride towards Rue Lepic before heading to Place du Tertre for a short walk through the streets. \r\n\r\nYou’ll also have the opportunity to explore many of the city’s famous landmarks, including The Basilica, the village of Montmartre, The Arc de Triomphe and Saint-Germain-des-Prés.",
