            "__typename": "AttractionsReview",
            "language": "en-gb",
            "id": "masked_3370912a-5c87-4079-8c3a-457fe67fea34",
            "content": "I would recommend this to any friend or family member. It was SUCH a thrill exploring Paris with Max as our driver. Those we passed by offered us smiles and one even offered to take a photo of us with our phone. My sister and I got great insights into Paris' history and architecture as we toured the city on his motorcycle. He was entertaining, kind, and generous with our final destination. \n\nThis is a MUST for anyone's itinerary!\n",
            "numericRating": 5,
            "epochMs": 1675505254000,
            "providerName": "viator",
            "rating": null,
            "votes": null,
            "isApproved": true,
            "date": "02/04/2023, 02:07:34"
        },
        {
            "id": "masked_28d6b097-c055-44e8-bc2a-93facabcf2e4",
            "__typename": "AttractionsReview",
            "language": "en-gb",
            "user": {
                "avatar": null,
                "__typename": "AttractionsReviewUser",
                "name": "masked_0f2446da-1ba9-482b-b5d5-add74af4d4b1",
                "cc1": ""
            },
            "numericRating": 5,
            "epochMs": 1672856603000,
            "content": "Alan & Roman were THEE BEST. My friends and I enjoyed each spot. They provided commentary, stories and were expert photographers. We have an amazing pictures and memories to memorialize our time in Paris. THANK YOU",
            "rating": null,
            "providerName": "viator",
            "isApproved": true,
            "votes": null,
            "date": "01/04/2023, 10:23:23"
        },
        {
            "epochMs": 1668395523000,
            "numericRating": 5,
            "content": "We loved every second of our tour with Michael! From Sacre Cour to the Latin Quarter, we got to explore alleys and neighborhoods where no bus tour could go. Plus the fun of being on a motorcycle with a sidecar 😁!! People waved, smiled, and laughed with us. \n\nMichael obviously loves Paris and is a fun, upbeat guide. We highly recommend. ",
            "__typename": "AttractionsReview",
