            "epochMs": 1665462643000,
            "numericRating": 5,
            "content": "Having been living in Paris for the last month, I was afraid this tour would be a bit “silly”, but I had first-timers to Paris with me and we had a fabulous, fun ride with delightful guide/drivers.  Everywhere we went, people smiled and waved.  A great time washad by all!",
            "date": "10/10/2022, 21:30:43"
        },
        {
